{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 在 S01、S05 这类短停留段落里，交替行和大量未延时出现的感受词比较密集，扫读不如 X 的左右分栏顺畅。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用【】突出心理关键词，又把人物的心理变化拆成更清楚的中间步骤，尤其 S06 从想靠近、怕自己要得太多到感到孤单，以及 S11 从彼此需要走向即使不被需要也愿意陪伴，动机比 X 更容易理解。S13—S14 对幸福、失去的恐惧和最终不再隐藏喜欢的转变也衔接得更完整，随音乐出现的感受词提供了更多细腻的情绪和声音变化。X 的优势是扫读轻松、文字组织紧凑，但部分心理转折和音乐细节被压缩掉了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b830fd69-0665-4822-88ec-0b6bd45e0c64", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T214023443670Z", "elapsed_seconds": 161.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:43:05.184239+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2e8908f3a701c9787d854e7fc02aa531c64d75b12c90a9ed7f76b73eb0e5850d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 